	of the 

	 sons of Bebai: Jehohanan, Hananiah, Zabbai, and Athlai;
 [2 Kin. 11:16; 2 Chr. 23:15; Jer.]

	Benjamin, Malluch, 

	 and Shemariah;
 [Neh. 3:1;]
